1
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:34,360
Don't be afraid.

2
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:35,690
I will control my power.

3
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:49,060
Are you okay?

4
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:50,830
I didn't use much force.

5
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:52,060
Why didn't you dodge?

6
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,660
You clearly have spiritual power too.

7
00:00:53,660 --> 00:00:56,520
When you repelled that man
in black the other day...

8
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:57,700
I don't know

9
00:00:58,530 --> 00:01:00,260
what happened that day either.

10
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:02,460
No matter how hard I tried later,

11
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,260
I couldn't use that power again.

12
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:07,500
Bai,

13
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,330
I don't know who I am,

14
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:11,230
or what is inside my body.

15
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,460
But I never want to hurt anyone.

16
00:01:13,630 --> 00:01:15,900
If you suspect me
because of that accident,

17
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:16,930
I understand.

18
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:18,760
But I am really not a spy.

19
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,430
It's

20
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:21,760
my fault.

21
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:23,360
I shouldn't have tested you.

22
00:01:24,130 --> 00:01:25,130
But

23
00:01:25,130 --> 00:01:26,200
I believe you.

24
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,630
Not because you saved me,

25
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:29,030
but because of your eyes.

26
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,800
Your eyes tell me

27
00:01:32,030 --> 00:01:33,259
you are a good person.

28
00:01:37,860 --> 00:01:38,660
Thank you.

29
00:01:54,330 --> 00:01:55,000
Mister,

30
00:01:55,330 --> 00:01:56,860
is this tea for me?

31
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,100
Ah,

32
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:03,430
it's delicious.

33
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:08,000
This is tea that will poison mortals.

34
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,760
Mister,

35
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,660
you are joking, right?

36
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,460
Do I look like someone who jokes?

37
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,400
Ah!

38
00:02:33,600 --> 00:02:35,130
I think I remembered it wrong.

39
00:02:35,130 --> 00:02:37,600
This tea is actually
very good for mortals.

40
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:39,100
So impatient.

41
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,490
It seems your mind lacks cultivation.

42
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:47,660
Mister,

43
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,060
do you think I'm a fool?

44
00:02:49,130 --> 00:02:50,230
What cultivation?

45
00:02:50,230 --> 00:02:52,290
You are clearly just messing with me.

46
00:03:01,730 --> 00:03:04,100
Where are you going? Explain it to me!

47
00:03:12,830 --> 00:03:15,360
Mister, can you hear me?

48
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,200
Oh no.

49
00:03:19,329 --> 00:03:20,730
I stayed in the woods too late

50
00:03:20,730 --> 00:03:22,260
and got separated from him.

51
00:03:34,700 --> 00:03:37,660
This is the cold pool
I fell into at the beginning.

52
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,060
This is where my memories begin.

53
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:47,030
Who am I,

54
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,760
and where did I come from?

55
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:16,200
It's so dark.

56
00:04:16,860 --> 00:04:18,399
Am I going to die here?

57
00:04:33,130 --> 00:04:35,700
What is this?

58
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:39,030
Why do I feel like I've seen it before?

59
00:05:28,330 --> 00:05:29,900
Mister,

60
00:05:30,030 --> 00:05:31,360
thank you for saving me.

61
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:32,960
Mmm.
